meta {
  name: 00 Preflight
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  # Preflight
  
  Run this folder first, every time you change **Preferences → General → HTTP version**.
  
  - Confirms the testbed server is up and trusted (custom CA configured).
  - Confirms the selected **environment** (`mode` var) matches the app preference. Every protocol assertion in the collection depends on this. If **Mode matches app setting** fails, fix the environment or preference before you go further.
}
